sequenceDiagram
  actor C as API client
  participant O as order-service API
  participant S as file-storage
  participant DB as orders-db
  participant B as message-broker
  participant T as orders topic
  C->>O: POST v1/{tenant}/orders
  O->>S: store attachments (temp folder)
  O->>DB: save Order CREATED
  O->>B: POST .../publish/{topic}
  alt topic exists
    B->>T: publish + orderSize attr
    T-->>B: messageId
  else topic missing
    B-->>O: 500 TOPIC_NOT_FOUND
  end
  B-->>O: 200
  O-->>C: 201 Created
  Note over O,B: broker call retries 5s x2
  Note over B,T: publisher cached per topic
